Create this in the project root:

FYERS_APP_ID=YOUR_APP_ID
FYERS_ACCESS_TOKEN=YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN


SYMBOL=NSE:SBIN-EQ

Do not upload .env to GitHub.

Create .gitignore:

.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
.venv/

The Fyers WebSocket token format is:

APP_ID:ACCESS_TOKEN

according to the current Fyers WebSocket documentation.
